    0.0       : Threshold for the Restart criterion: Growing-degree days
     0         : Number of successive days for the Restart criterion
     0         : Number of occurrences before the Restart criterion applies
    0         : The End of growth is generated by other method
    0         : Last Day for the time window (End of growth)
    0         : Last Month for the time window (End of growth)
     0         : Number of years to add to the Onset year
    0         : Length (days) of the time window (End of growth)
    0.0       : Threshold for the End criterion: Growing-degree days
     0         : Number of successive days for the End criterion
     0         : Number of occurrences before the End criterion applies